<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Title 1"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="title"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr><a:normAutofit fontScale="90000"/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"/><a:r><a:rPr sz="3200"><a:latin typeface="Arial Black"/></a:rPr><a:t>Challenges, Solutions and Key Learnings</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="Content Placeholder 2"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="609600" y="1752600"/><a:ext cx="7620000" cy="4373563"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr><a:noAutofit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"/><a:t>Challenge: </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/><a:t>Understanding networking concepts such as subnetting, routing and VLAN configuration was initially difficult.</a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/></a:br><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"/><a:t>Solution: </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/><a:t>Practised network configuration using Cisco Packet Tracer and repeated lab exercises.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"/><a:t>Challenge: </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/><a:t>Interpreting Nmap scan results and identifying open ports and services required practical experience.</a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/></a:br><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"/><a:t>Solution: </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/><a:t>Performed repeated scans on authorised lab systems and studied the scan output.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"/><a:t>Challenge: </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/><a:t>Identifying potentially risky exposed services was challenging.</a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/></a:br><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"/><a:t>Solution: </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/><a:t>Created configurable security rules to analyse open ports and classify their risk levels.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"/><a:t>Challenge: </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/><a:t>Understanding vulnerability findings and their severity required security knowledge.</a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/></a:br><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"/><a:t>Solution: </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/><a:t>Studied Nessus reports, CVE information and recommended remediation methods during internship training.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" dirty="0"/><a:t>Key Learning: </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/><a:t>Gained practical knowledge of network configuration, Nmap scanning, vulnerability assessment, security analysis and report preparation through internship training and project development.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="0"/><a:endParaRPr lang="en-IN" sz="1500" b="0" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>